    <string name="settings_help_title">The service stops on its own</string>
    <string name="settings_help_intro">To save battery, some phones stop the apps they consider idle, accessibility services included. SeekMind then stops remembering, until you turn it back on.</string>
    <string name="settings_help_reactivate">If the search screen says “Service turned off”, tap “Turn back on” and enable SeekMind again in the accessibility settings. To keep it from stopping again, exclude SeekMind from battery optimisation as shown below for your phone.</string>
    <string name="settings_help_samsung">Samsung</string>
    <string name="settings_help_samsung_steps">1. Settings › Apps › SeekMind › Battery: choose “Unrestricted”.\n2. Settings › Battery › Background usage limits: make sure SeekMind is in neither “Sleeping apps” nor “Deep sleeping apps”.</string>
    <string name="settings_help_xiaomi">Xiaomi, Redmi, POCO</string>
    <string name="settings_help_xiaomi_steps">1. Settings › Apps › Manage apps › SeekMind › Battery saver: choose “No restrictions”.\n2. On the same page, turn on “Autostart”.</string>
    <string name="settings_help_oppo">Oppo, Realme</string>
    <string name="settings_help_oppo_steps">1. Settings › Apps › App management › SeekMind › Battery usage: allow background activity.\n2. On the same page, allow auto launch.</string>
    <string name="settings_help_huawei">Huawei, Honor</string>
    <string name="settings_help_huawei_steps">1. Settings › Battery › App launch › SeekMind: turn off “Manage automatically”.\n2. In the window that opens, keep “Auto-launch”, “Secondary launch” and “Run in background” on.</string>
    <string name="settings_help_oneplus">OnePlus</string>
    <string name="settings_help_oneplus_steps">1. Settings › Apps › SeekMind › Battery: allow background activity.\n2. Settings › Battery › Battery optimisation › SeekMind: choose “Don\'t optimise”.</string>
    <string name="settings_help_other">Other phones</string>
    <string name="settings_help_other_steps">Settings › Apps › SeekMind › Battery: choose “Unrestricted” (or “Not optimised”).</string>
    <string name="settings_help_versions">Menu names vary with the version of Android and of the manufacturer\'s interface: look for the closest wording.</string>
